        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Nkaambo kakuti ba-Edomu bakacitila luzubo lwa-Juda cakuliya inkoto, alimwi babisya loko mukuliya inkoto zyabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbuboobu mbwaamba Mwami Jehova. Njootandabika ijanza lyangu kukulwisya cisi ca-Edomu, nkabela njoonyonyoona bantu abanyama boonse mukati kaco. Njoocita kuti cibe matongo buyo. Kuzwa ku-Temani akusikila ku-Dedani, koonse bayoojazigwa ipanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.13"
            ]
          }
        },
